{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0212_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0212_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d3eb946aa3267fde1d45cba616cdb37d9b8e406c62bd95d8a682e91d6864a634", "ja": "（学園ドラマに出演する事になったエレナ。\n見せ場である、書道のシーンの収録が終わった）", "zh": "（艾蕾娜要出演校园剧。作为亮点的书法场景也拍摄完了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0212_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0212_1001_018ele", "source_sha256": "afad221f3f737d77dbbdc6b6608ab3f0ec54f597b9bf7c358d167cda830285d3", "ja": "ねえねえ、{$P$}！\n顔についた墨、ちゃんととれたカナー？", "zh": "喂喂，{$P$}！\n脸上的墨汁，已经好好洗掉了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0212_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0212_1002_p", "source_sha256": "ad6d71e0d275c0c5260da61b8ecf3bfd093931197d3c9feeb02670d3e3c5a81d", "ja": "ああ、綺麗になってるよ。\n撮影中も、たくさん墨が飛び散ってたもんな。", "zh": "啊，已经擦干净了。\n拍摄过程中也有好多墨汁飞溅过来呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0212_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0212_1003_018ele", "source_sha256": "843a585e85741e111f969e439b0fc5cd7eca8a259d45fa6011886da4e865d7f5", "ja": "えへへっ♪　ダンスみたいで、楽しくなっちゃって。\nそしたら、すごいことになっちゃった。", "zh": "嘿嘿♪像跳舞一样，不知不觉就玩得开心起来了。结果就变成这样了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0212_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0212_1004_018ele", "source_sha256": "569c4a6321cf0d299565a33ed6b2ccec476f24acaddaecab8a7da6f7aed26ccd", "ja": "きっと、いろんな人に墨がかかっちゃったよネ……。\nみんな、大丈夫だったカナ？", "zh": "肯定有很多人被溅到墨汁了吧……  \n大家都没事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0212_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0212_1005_p", "source_sha256": "6e8aed5a04e77c2c97372a561e107d58224e2487651596313da0d205f72b608b", "ja": "ビニールで対策はしてたから、大丈夫だよ。\nその分、動きのあるシーンが撮れたと思う。", "zh": "因为事先用塑料布做了防护，所以没事。\n也正因为这样，我觉得才能拍到富有动感的场景。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0212_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0212_1006_018ele", "source_sha256": "72180e426b7131c4d18168b4fdb592ed400e958a16bb2e2876ef379cb0aa87b3", "ja": "そっか！　……あれ？\n{$P$}の顔にも、墨がついてるヨ？", "zh": "这样啊！……咦？  \n{$P$}的脸上也沾上墨了哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0212_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0212_1007_p", "source_sha256": "0134dbc043e8e0e7a654d700daaf634dfb6590854fd6919c401333c5c59609e3", "ja": "え？　いつの間についたんだろう？\nえっと……どこだ？", "zh": "诶？什么时候沾上的呢？\n呃……在哪儿呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0212_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0212_1008_018ele", "source_sha256": "431baf147f6a3d863c007ddacb9c66191d8efa67e7b90bc5781359e20c41532e", "ja": "ほっぺについてるヨ～！\n待ってネ、ワタシがキレイにしてあげるカラ！", "zh": "粘在脸颊上啦～！\n等一下哦，我来帮你擦干净！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0212_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0212_1009_null", "source_sha256": "22d045446656fdde8f1fe791f19d1b55fbb89d4e135ec1e4d3e5faa990775338", "ja": "ゴシゴシ！", "zh": "擦擦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0212_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0212_1010_018ele", "source_sha256": "fec855a5feb78929d9d75b4354085f93ae770a6bbe43c72e0daa53a1959722f2", "ja": "うん、キレイになったヨ～！\nワタシ、スタッフのみんなもゴシゴシしてくるネ～！", "zh": "嗯，变干净了哟～！\n我也去帮大家把工作人员擦干净吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0212_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0212_1011_p", "source_sha256": "fa81c453462d3d324629fb298ccc901a8e2dd864e6939c6c7d0463cab898a49b", "ja": "（エレナの気遣いで、みんなも気持ちよく\n仕事ができそうだ……ありがとう、エレナ！）", "zh": "（多亏了艾蕾娜的体贴，大家应该也能愉快地工作了……谢谢你，艾蕾娜！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
